# Account & Data Deletion — TradeKnowledge Academy

**Last updated: [06/10/2026]**

This page explains how to delete your TradeKnowledge Academy account and the data
associated with it. You can request deletion in two ways.

## Option 1 — Delete in the app (fastest)

1. Open the TradeKnowledge Academy app and sign in.
2. Go to **Profile / Settings**.
3. Tap **Delete Account**.
4. Confirm. Your account and associated data are removed.

## Option 2 — Request deletion by email

If you no longer have the app installed, email us at **[SUPPORT EMAIL]** from the email
address on your account and ask us to delete your account. We will verify the request
and delete your account and associated data within **[30] days**.

## What gets deleted

When you delete your account, we remove:

- Your account and login credentials (email).
- Your learning data tied to your account — progress, quiz results, points, streaks,
  and levels.

Data stored only on your device (such as Jobsite Notes and Apprenticeship Hours) is
removed when you delete the app or clear its data.

## What may be retained, and why

We may retain a limited record of **purchase/transaction history** where we are required
to keep it for legal, tax, accounting, or fraud-prevention purposes. These records are
kept only as long as the law requires and are not used to identify you for any other
purpose. **[Confirm this matches your actual practice; if you retain nothing, delete this
section.]**

